      "id": 428293,
      "username": "Phipsoft",
      "name": "phipsoft.com",
      "created_at": "2024-08-12T11:21:50.904Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can check frappe/core/doctype/report/report.py.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">#save the timestamp to automatically set to prepared\nthreshold = 15\n</code></pre>\n<p>if the query time exceeds 15 seconds, the “Prepare Report” button will automatically be re-enabled.<br>\nYou can chang 15 to 60 or …<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/90731b690cba28523ecb0c2c4eeffd5c05db9b1e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/90731b690cba28523ecb0c2c4eeffd5c05db9b1e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/90731b690cba28523ecb0c2c4eeffd5c05db9b1e_2_690x198.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kBRn24Qngh5TpvnljCnFNDjni6a\" width=\"690\" height=\"198\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/90731b690cba28523ecb0c2c4eeffd5c05db9b1e_2_690x198.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/0/90731b690cba28523ecb0c2c4eeffd5c05db9b1e_2_1035x297.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/0/90731b690cba28523ecb0c2c4eeffd5c05db9b1e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F2F4F3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1376×396 27.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
