      "created_at": "2025-08-31T06:34:06.042Z",
      "cooked": "<p>check out this</p><aside class=\"quote quote-modified\" data-post=\"9\" data-topic=\"124065\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/sanaullahaq/48/49703_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/t/why-is-prepared-report-button-auto-enabled-in-frappe-v15/124065/9\">Why is 'Prepared Report' Button Auto-Enabled in Frappe v15?</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/erpnext/reports/26\"><span data-category-id=\"26\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #12A89D; --category-badge-text-color: #FFFFFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #BF1E2E;\" data-parent-category-id=\"6\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Reports</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    What we have done is given below. Though this is not perfect, but it works \nI call the disable_prepared_report_being_checked() before return columns, data statment in the script_report.py file. \ndef disable_prepared_report_being_checked(report_name):\n    \"\"\"\n    Uncheck the prepared_report checkbox and remove `Prepared Report` entity (if any)\n    \"\"\"\n    frappe.db.set_value('Report', report_name, 'prepared_report', 0)\n    # frappe.db.delete('Prepared Report')               # Truncates the entire…\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n",
